  grammarTitle: 'Present Perfect: for and since',
  grammarNote: '"For" и "since" с Present Perfect — действия начались в прошлом и ПРОДОЛЖАЮТСЯ сейчас.\n\n📌 FOR — период времени (КАК ДОЛГО? = how long?)\n"I have lived in Uralsk for five years." (пять лет)\n"She has studied English for three months."\n\nС "for": minutes · hours · days · weeks · months · years · ages · a long time\n\n📌 SINCE — точка отсчёта (С КАКОГО МОМЕНТА? = since when?)\n"I have lived here since 2019." (с 2019 года)\n"She has studied since January."\n\nС "since": конкретный год, месяц, день, или событие\n\n💡 Простое правило:\nFOR + период → for five years / for a week / for ages\nSINCE + момент → since 2020 / since Monday / since I was a child\n\n⚠️ Типичные ошибки:\n❌ "I live here for 5 years." → ✅ "I HAVE LIVED here for 5 years."\n❌ "She is here since Monday." → ✅ "She HAS BEEN here since Monday."',
