  grammarTip: "Travel collocations — главные сочетания:\n\nBOOK: a room, a flight, a ticket, a hostel, a tour\nTAKE: a bus, a train, a taxi, a flight (как добраться)\nCATCH: a bus, a train (успеть / не опоздать)\nMISS: a flight, a connection, a train (опоздать)\nGO ON: a trip, a holiday, an excursion, a tour\nGET TO: как добраться (\"How do I get to...?\")\n\n⚠️ Ловушки:\n✗ \"arrive to Almaty\" → ✅ \"arrive IN Almaty\"\n✗ \"make a trip\" → ✅ \"go ON a trip\"\n✗ \"travel a flight\" → ✅ \"take / book a flight\"\n\nFixed phrases:\n\"travel light\" / \"set off early\" / \"make the most of\"\n\"pack your bags\" / \"off the beaten track\"",

