  grammarTip: "Retrospective Modals:\n\nshould have + pp → criticism/regret (didn\'t do)\n\"You SHOULD HAVE told me.\" (you didn\'t — mistake)\n\nshouldn\'t have + pp → criticism (did do)\n\"You SHOULDN'T HAVE said that.\" (you said — mistake)\n\ncould have + pp → opportunity existed but unused\n\"She COULD HAVE applied.\" (option was there)\n\nneedn\'t have + pp → done but unnecessary\n\"You NEEDN'T HAVE bought so much.\" (you did, wasted effort)\n\nought to have + pp → stronger should have\n\"They OUGHT TO HAVE been informed.\"\n\nwas able to = managed to do (specific achievement)\ncould have + pp = had ability but didn\'t use it\n\n⚠️ Errors:\n✗ should have went → ✅ should have GONE\n✗ needn\'t have to → ✅ needn\'t have (no \'to')\n✗ could have avoid → ✅ could have AVOIDED",

