  grammarTip: "Reported Speech — Statements:\n\n📌 Backshift: глагол «сдвигается назад»\nPS → PP → Past Perfect\nPC → Past Continuous\nPPS → Past Perfect Simple\nPPC → Past Perfect Continuous\nwill → would · can → could · may → might · must → had to\n\n📌 SAY vs TELL:\nSay: \"She SAID (that) she was tired.\" (no object needed)\nTell: \"She TOLD ME (that) she was tired.\" (ALWAYS + object!)\n✗ \"She told that...\" → ✅ \"She told him/me/us that...\"\n\n📌 Time/place shifts:\nnow → then · today → that day\ntomorrow → the next day · here → there\n\n📌 When NOT to shift:\n→ Universal truths (sun rises in east)\n→ Reporting immediately\n→ would/could/might/should — already past!\n→ Still true at the moment of reporting\n\n📌 B1 Reporting verbs + that:\nadmit / claim / insist / promise / explain / complain\n→ + to-inf: promise to / agree to / refuse to / offer to",

