    'You are Aigerim Bekova, a recent graduate applying for an internship at GlobalLink, an international NGO. Write a semi-formal email to the Internship Coordinator:\n• Introduce yourself and explain why you are interested in this internship\n• Mention two specific skills or experiences that make you suitable\n• Ask one question about the internship programme\n• Close appropriately (150–180 words)',
